        "date": "2025-10-20",
        "observations": "Actually viewed full front/side image: four fluted Ionic columns across the roofed deep portico, return columns, intact front pediment with layered cornice/dentils, high podium and front stairs, engaged side shafts, light/weathered stone wall, dark roof tile edges and a recessed closed entrance. Surrounding church/modern buildings remain independent."
