        "date": "2004-06-11",
        "observations": "Actually viewed rear/side image: four engaged fluted rear columns, engaged side shafts, rear triangular pediment and complete shallow gable roof. Weathered wall fields, lost stucco and repair patterns remain approximate; the older rear photo does not establish exact current surface damage."
      }
